    <string name="toybox_settings">Settings</string>
    <string name="toybox_driving_guide_body">STEER\nMove the left stick sideways. Hold GAS to accelerate; BRAKE slows down, then reverses.\n\nDRIFT &amp; BOOST\nHOP is beside the left stick. Press it to jump, then slide the same finger sideways to steer without lifting it. Hold while turning to drift. Keep the slide going to fill the three-level ribbon gauge, then release HOP to boost.\n\nRACE\nComplete three laps in the right direction. Pass each checkpoint on the road. The white arrow on the map is you; the gold ring marks your next checkpoint.\n\nEXPLORE\nFree drive has no timer target. Leave the road and discover the oversized scenery.\n\nGAMEPAD\nLeft stick: steering · RT / A: gas · LT / B: brake · LB / RB / X: hop and drift · Start: pause · Y: restart.\n\nCOMFORT\nAdjust steering response, camera view, motion and vibration in Settings.</string>
